============================================================
Third-party components
============================================================

This product depends on the following third-party libraries:

- Slint (https://slint.dev/) — used by the `tablet-slint` crate
  (the GUI binary `tablet`).
  Slint is offered under multiple licenses; this project consumes
  Slint under the GNU General Public License v3 (GPL-3.0). As a
  result, the GUI binary `tablet` (which statically links Slint)
  is distributed under GPL-3.0. The CLI binary `tablet-cli` does
  NOT depend on Slint and is distributed solely under Apache-2.0.
